error BYN1063: `requires` on a function is an input form; write `expects`

  1 │ i64 half(i64 n) requires n >= 0 {
    │                 ^^^^^^^^ the input form
    │
  help: use `expects` for a precondition; `requires` is checked at construction
    │ 1 │ i64 half(i64 n) expects n >= 0 {
    │   │                 ++++++
